msgstr "回忆上下文"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/recall-context|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Context-plan recall parameters, immutable attention-slot claims, record-specific exclusions, recall activities and asker verdicts."
msgstr "上下文计划回忆参数、不可变注意槽主张、逐记录排除、回忆活动及提问者判定。"

