msgstr "连同来源、作用域和记录身份保留显式 verdictWords 值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verdictWords|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record verdict words within an attributed recall context."
msgstr "用于在带有归属的回忆上下文中记录判定原话。"

