msgstr "将 ExclusionReasonLanguageConstraint 应用于显式限定范围的记录，并保留原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ExclusionReasonLanguageConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
